          "order": 8,
          "speaker": "protagonist",
          "speakerName": "主角",
          "indigenousText": "mi’o o’te mahafo to peisu . te’o meelʉ yuevaho no peisusu?",
          "chineseText": "我沒有帶錢。你可以借我錢嗎？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/62884/876556.mp3",
